# Theme and UI

- Colours, spacing, type, radius, and elevation come from `@medmate/theme`.
- No raw hex in `base-components`. Pass `semantic.*` or a NativeWind class.
- `Text` variants stay the iOS scale, Material scale, or `typeRoles`.
- `Button` tones stay `filled`, `forest`, `gold`, `outline`, `muted`, `mint`.
- Do not put catalogue, cart, order, pharmacy, or care sections in `base-components`.
- Join classes with `cn` from the theme. Do not add `tailwind-merge`.
